      "hook": "Read this slowly.",
      "caption": "Read this slowly.\n\n“…postponement is the greatest waste of life: it wrings day after day from us, and takes away the present by promising something hereafter: there is no such obstacle to true living as waiting, which loses today while it is depending on the morrow.”\n— Seneca, On the Shortness of Life 9\n\nSave this. You'll need it.\n\n#stoicism #stoic #seneca #motivation #philosophy #mindset"
